[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647712320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102248#issuecomment-2647712320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102248","id":2647712320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6d0OJA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T11:29:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T11:29:15Z","body":"> However this has a side-effect of always closing resources when node is deselected.\r\n\r\nThat sounds pretty annoying if editing a specific subresource and having to switch between separate node selections to check something. Having to re-unfold everything to go back to where you were a second before would break the flow, no?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2647712320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654865394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102248#issuecomment-2654865394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102248","id":2654865394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ePgfy","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-12T21:18:24Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T21:19:37Z","body":"The alternative is that your editor may switch to another tab (which happens right now, and which the issue is about), but it's much less common.\r\nCan't say how much if affects workflow, I'd have to test it for a bit, but it depends on what editor do you use.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2654865394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676134918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102248#issuecomment-2676134918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102248","id":2676134918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fgpQG","user":{"login":"rbogdy","id":8807130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDcxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8807130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy","html_url":"https://github.com/rbogdy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rbogdy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T10:20:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T10:20:58Z","body":"I ran into this issue when working on a shader that was importing a shader include. I attached a small project that replicates this issue. \r\nIt seems like the problem does not only happen when chosing another node in the scene tree. \r\n\r\nI used v4.4.rc1.official [8ed125b42] to test, and I can't replicate the issue in v4.3.stable.official [77dcf97d8]\r\n\r\nSteps:\r\n\r\n1. Select the ColorRect Node in the main scene\r\n2. Unfold the Material and then unfold the Shader\r\n3. Open the circle_shader_include, shaderinclude file and delete a letter on line 2. Wait for like a second and you will see how the Bottom Panel jumps back to the color_shader gdshader file\r\n\r\nMy work around is to fold the Shader panel while having the ColorRect node selected and that will let me work on the errors in the shaderinclude file, without switching.\r\n\r\nProject: \r\n[BottomPanelBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18921819/BottomPanelBug.zip)\r\n\r\nEDIT: Forgot to attach the project\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676134918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676156151","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102248#issuecomment-2676156151","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102248","id":2676156151,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fgub3","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T11:27:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T12:01:06Z","body":"That looks like separate issue. I don't see why the Shader would be edited in this case.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nI opened https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103159","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676156151/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0